<title>DENMARK: Denmark's KFK 1996 profits slump.</title>
<headline>Denmark's KFK 1996 profits slump.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31 1996</p>
<p>					  (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net result			 75  vs 191</p>
<p> Group operating pre-tax result     140 vs 322</p>
<p> Group net turnover		   7,772 vs 7,396</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (percent)	   unchanged 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of leading Danish grain and feedstuffs wholesaler is A/S Korn og Foderstof Kompagniet (KFK). It said in a statement that it expected a &quot;somewhat better&quot; 1997 result.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom, 45-33-969650</p>
</text>
